            >
            <span
              class="surface-chip px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-gray-300 dark:border-neutral-700 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
              >OpenAI</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pt-4"
          >
            <span
              class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-400"
              >Adaptive UX</span
            >
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
            >
              Workshop ready
              <svg
                class="w-4 h-4"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                  d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article
          class="surface-card group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-neutral-800 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-[0_18px_42px_rgba(15,15,15,0.08)] dark:shadow-[0_26px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_28px_70px_rgba(15,15,15,0.12)] dark:hover:shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)]"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-400"
          >
            <span>Healthcare</span>
            <span>2023</span>
          </div>
          <h3
            class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold font-display text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
          >
            HealthSync
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-neutral-200 leading-relaxed"
          >
            HIPAA-compliant telehealth platform with synchronized clinician and
            patient apps, offline-first data sync, and automated reporting for
            multi-site practices.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="surface-chip px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-gray-300 dark:border-neutral-700 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
              >React Native</span
            >
            <span
              class="surface-chip px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-gray-300 dark:border-neutral-700 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
              >Express</span
            >
            <span
              class="surface-chip px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-gray-300 dark:border-neutral-700 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
              >AWS</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pt-4"
          >
            <span
              class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-400"
              >Offline first</span
            >
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
            >
              Cross-platform
              <svg
                class="w-4 h-4"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                  d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      id="about"
      class="py-10 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-neutral-800"
    >
      <div class="mb-8 md:mb-10">
        <span
          class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-black text-gray-700 dark:text-neutral-200 rounded-full text-sm font-medium font-mono mb-3"
          >Background</span
        >
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold font-display text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
        >
          Professional Journey
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div
          class="absolute left-8 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gray-200 dark:bg-neutral-800"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8 md:space-y-12">
          <div class="flex flex-row items-start gap-6 relative pl-20">
            <div
              class="absolute left-7 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-neutral-900"
            >
            </div>
            <div
              class="absolute left-0 top-1 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-100 dark:bg-neutral-950 flex items-center justify-center"
            >
              <span
                class="font-bold font-mono text-gray-700 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >2023</span
              >
            </div>
            <div
              class="surface-card border border-gray-200 dark:border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-[0_12px_35px_rgba(15,15,15,0.08)] dark:shadow-[0_20px_45px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] w-full"
            >
              <div
                class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2 mb-3"
              >
                <h3
                  class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                >
                  Independent Product Engineer
                </h3>
                <span
                  class="text-sm font-medium font-mono text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-400"
                  >2023 — Present</span
                >
              </div>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-neutral-200 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  <span
                    >Building full-stack applications for startups across
                    fintech, AI, and healthcare</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  <span
                    >Delivered 15+ projects with focus on scalable architecture</span
