              >
                <h3
                  class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                >
                  Software Developer, GeekSynergy
                </h3>
                <span
                  class="text-sm font-medium font-mono text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-400"
                  >2022 — 2023</span
                >
              </div>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-neutral-200 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  <span
                    >Maintained enterprise SaaS platforms with 99.9% uptime</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  <span
                    >Reduced API latency by 40% through performance optimization</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  <span>Implemented RBAC for multi-tenant systems</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <span
            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-black text-gray-700 dark:text-neutral-200 rounded-full text-sm font-medium font-mono mb-3"
            >Technical Skills</span
          >
          <h2
            class="text-3xl font-bold font-display text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
